162:| ADR-0065 | Automation rules (`automation_rule`) are not carried by configuration bundles: every admin rule names its owner by user id, which has no stable key. An export that names the kind is refused with `config_bundle.unportable_reference`; an imported item of the kind is refused. Automation rule sets (Studio) are carried. A target installation recreates its automation rules by hand, with its own owners (Amendment 1, A1.2; the export screen does not offer the kind). |
30:6. **قواعد الأتمتة (`automation_rule`):** لا تنقلها حزم الإعدادات في هذا الإصدار، لأن كل قاعدة تسمّي مالكها بمعرّف مستخدم ليس له مفتاح ثابت. يُرفض التصدير الذي يسمّي هذا النوع بالرمز `config_bundle.unportable_reference`، ويُرفض أي عنصر مستورد منه. مجموعات قواعد الأتمتة (Studio) تُنقل. تعيد المنشأة المستهدفة إنشاء قواعد الأتمتة يدوياً بمالكيها (ADR-0065).
137:> DG7 analyst pass (T-DG7-AN-P7, base 3386b90, 2026-11-14): RELEASE BLOCKER at this pass, not IMPLEMENTED. Missing dependency: (1) the automation_rule kind has no bundle adapter, so automation rules do not travel (only automation_rule_set does; BE-F gap 1, undecided BE-F questions carried by D-253), which leaves the 'automation configuration' part of the title partly met; (2) test T-D7 (an imported methodology draft published over a running transformation triggers the ADR-0040 migration) is not written (BE-F gap 2); (3) route-inventory case 4 (uploadConfigBundleImport answers 422 where the sweep expects 400) failed in BE-H's run and no later run is recorded. Done: QA-B's A06 replay on an imported bundle PASS; an unknown schema version is refused (BE-F suite). DG7 analyst pass 2 (T-DG7-AN-P7B, base 55742fd, 2026-11-14): still a RELEASE BLOCKER, not IMPLEMENTED. Closed since pass 1 (BE-F2, integrated by D-267): T-D7 written and passing (imported draft published and migrated exactly as a hand-made one, two mutants fail it); route-inventory case 4 now {400: 490} (6 integration files 286/286); an export naming automation_rule is 422 config_bundle.unportable_reference and an imported item is refused kind_unavailable with nothing written. So the acceptance tests (A06 replay, T-D7, unknown schema version refused) have run and passed. Missing: (1) the requirement names automation configuration, and individual automation_rule records do not travel (11 of 12 kinds; automation_rule_set does). ARCH-R7's ADR-0065 Amendment 1 decides this out of scope for DG7, but the orchestrator has not yet adopted it (ARCH-R7 Q5); (2) the known-limitations entry ADR-0065 Residual 1 requires is not in docs/handover/known-limitations.md or its Arabic summary (DOC-B). With both done, the row is IMPLEMENTED with that limitation disclosed, which the release-auditor may judge against the literal title.
